title: A file changed from outside while its caret is in it (nothing unsaved) is read again, and typing then goes on top of the new text
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\AXfirst of a\nsecond of a\nappended outside\n\z

wait 3000
goto a.txt
wait 800
edit a.txt 1 1
touch a.txt appended outside
wait 2500
mark read-again
wait 400
type X
key save
wait 600
quit
